msgid "Expat C API"
msgstr "C API Expat"

msgid ""
"The :mod:`xml.parsers.expat` module exposes selected Expat functions through "
"its ``expat_CAPI`` capsule. This allows extension modules to use the same "
"Expat library as Python. The interface is declared in :file:`pyexpat.h`, "
"which must be included after Expat's :file:`expat.h` header."
msgstr ""
"Modul :mod:`xml.parsers.expat` mengekspos fungsi-fungsi Expat tertentu "
"melalui kapsul ``expat_CAPI``-nya. Hal ini memungkinkan modul ekstensi "
"menggunakan pustaka Expat yang sama dengan Python. Antarmuka tersebut "
"dideklarasikan dalam :file:`pyexpat.h`, yang harus disertakan setelah "
"header :file:`expat.h` milik Expat."

msgid ""
"The name of the capsule containing the Expat C API: "
"``\"pyexpat.expat_CAPI\"``. Pass this to :c:func:`PyCapsule_Import` to "
"obtain a pointer to a :c:struct:`PyExpat_CAPI`."
msgstr ""
"Nama kapsul yang berisi C API Expat: ``\"pyexpat.expat_CAPI\"``. Teruskan "
"nilai ini ke :c:func:`PyCapsule_Import` untuk memperoleh pointer "
"ke :c:struct:`PyExpat_CAPI`."

msgid ""
"The string identifying the layout of :c:struct:`PyExpat_CAPI`. Before using "
"the function pointers in the structure, check that its ``magic`` member "
"compares equal to this string using ``strcmp()`` and  its ``size`` member is "
"at least :c:expr:`sizeof(struct PyExpat_CAPI)`."
msgstr ""
"String yang mengidentifikasi tata letak :c:struct:`PyExpat_CAPI`. Sebelum "
"menggunakan pointer fungsi dalam struktur tersebut, periksa bahwa anggota "
"``magic``-nya sama dengan string ini saat dibandingkan menggunakan "
"``strcmp()`` dan anggota ``size``-nya paling sedikit :c:expr:`sizeof(struct "
"PyExpat_CAPI)`."

msgid ""
"Table of function pointers exported by :mod:`xml.parsers.expat`. The capsule "
"owns this structure: treat it as read-only and do not free it. Keep a strong "
"reference to the capsule while using the table."
msgstr ""
"Tabel pointer fungsi yang diekspor oleh :mod:`xml.parsers.expat`. Kapsul "
"memiliki struktur ini: perlakukan struktur ini sebagai hanya-baca dan jangan "
"bebaskan. Pertahankan referensi kuat ke kapsul selama tabel digunakan."

msgid ""
"Check the compatibility fields as described "
"under :c:macro:`PyExpat_CAPI_MAGIC` before using the function pointers."
msgstr ""
"Periksa field kompatibilitas sebagaimana dijelaskan "
"pada :c:macro:`PyExpat_CAPI_MAGIC` sebelum menggunakan pointer fungsi."

msgid "Interface identifier, set to :c:macro:`PyExpat_CAPI_MAGIC`."
msgstr "Pengidentifikasi antarmuka, diatur ke :c:macro:`PyExpat_CAPI_MAGIC`."

msgid ""
"Size of the structure in bytes, set to ``sizeof(struct PyExpat_CAPI)`` by "
"the :mod:`xml.parsers.expat` module that created the capsule."
msgstr ""
"Ukuran struktur dalam byte, diatur ke ``sizeof(struct PyExpat_CAPI)`` oleh "
"modul :mod:`xml.parsers.expat` yang membuat kapsul."

msgid ""
"Major, minor, and micro version numbers of the Expat library used "
"by :mod:`xml.parsers.expat`."
msgstr ""
"Nomor versi major, minor, dan micro dari pustaka Expat yang digunakan "
"oleh :mod:`xml.parsers.expat`."

msgid ""
"Pointer to `XML_SetUnknownEncodingHandler <https://libexpat.github.io/doc/"
"api/latest/#XML_SetUnknownEncodingHandler>`_. The handler may set a Python "
"exception on failure. The caller must check for a Python exception after "
"parsing."
msgstr ""
"Pointer ke `XML_SetUnknownEncodingHandler <https://libexpat.github.io/doc/"
"api/latest/#XML_SetUnknownEncodingHandler>`_. Handler dapat mengatur eksepsi "
"Python saat gagal. Pemanggil harus memeriksa eksepsi Python setelah parsing."

msgid ""
"Python's unknown-encoding handler for Expat, used with "
"``XML_SetUnknownEncodingHandler``. It uses Python's codec registry to fill "
"*info*. The *encodingHandlerData* argument is unused. Calling this handler "
"requires an :term:`attached thread state`."
msgstr ""
"Handler Python untuk pengodean yang tidak dikenal pada Expat, yang digunakan "
"bersama ``XML_SetUnknownEncodingHandler``. Handler ini menggunakan registri "
"codec Python untuk mengisi *info*. Argumen *encodingHandlerData* tidak "
"digunakan. Pemanggilan handler ini memerlukan :term:`attached thread state`."

msgid ""
"Pointers to the corresponding Expat functions, or ``NULL`` if not available "
"in the Expat version used by :mod:`xml.parsers.expat`, are listed below."
msgstr ""
"Pointer ke fungsi-fungsi Expat yang sesuai, atau ``NULL`` jika tidak "
"tersedia pada versi Expat yang digunakan oleh :mod:`xml.parsers.expat`, "
"tercantum di bawah ini."

msgid ""
"Member names omit the ``XML_`` prefix; for example, ``SetHashSalt`` exposes "
"Expat's ``XML_SetHashSalt`` function. See the `Expat API reference <https://"
"libexpat.github.io/doc/api/latest/>`_ for their behavior and the minimum "
"Expat version they appear in."
msgstr ""
"Nama anggota menghilangkan prefiks ``XML_``; sebagai contoh, ``SetHashSalt`` "
"mengekspos fungsi ``XML_SetHashSalt`` milik Expat. Lihat `Referensi API "
"Expat <https://libexpat.github.io/doc/api/latest/>`_ untuk perilaku fungsi-"
"fungsi tersebut dan versi minimum Expat yang menyediakan fungsi-fungsi "
"tersebut."

msgid ""
"See the `Expat API reference <https://libexpat.github.io/doc/api/latest/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Lihat `Referensi API Expat <https://libexpat.github.io/doc/api/latest/>`_."
